  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place potato on a lined oven tray. Season to taste, drizzle with olive oil and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. Allow to cool.\n• TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the potato between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688957c51cc5cea712808638/step-72137300.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice capsicum and cucumber.\n• Pick mint leaves and finely chop.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Cut paneer into 1cm bite-sized chunks.\n• In a medium bowl, add paneer and Mumbai spice blend, turning to coat.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil and garlic over medium-high heat until fragrant, 1 minute. Transfer to a small bowl.\n• Add Greek-style yoghurt to garlic oil mixture and combine. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688957c51cc5cea712808638/step-cfcf6c10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook paneer, in batches, tossing for 2-4 minutes until golden brown.\n• Remove from heat, then add the honey and turn to coat. Transfer to a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688957c51cc5cea712808638/step-63e96c20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wipe out frying pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Add capsicum and cook, tossing, until tender, 4-5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688957c51cc5cea712808638/step-f86bc830.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine mint, a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil and a pinch of salt and pepper.\n• To the dressing, add cucumber, charred capsicum, mixed salad leaves and roasted potatoes. Toss to combine and season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688957c51cc5cea712808638/step-174a6e40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide potato salad between bowls.\n• Top with Mumbai honey paneer.\n• Drizzle over garlic yoghurt to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688957c51cc5cea712808638/step-8053fe50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
